OL,3,APolice worker jailed after death of boy
OL,4,Ain her care
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who worked at Nottinghamshire
OL,7,FPolice has been jailed after the death
OL,8,Fof a nine-year-old boy in her care.
OL,10,FCatherine Walker, 47, was the legal
OL,11,Fguardian of the boy, who was found
OL,12,Funresponsive in his bedroom in Warsop,
OL,13,FNottinghamshire, on 16 December 2024.
OL,14,FDespite the efforts of paramedics and
OL,15,Fpeople at the scene, the boy died in
OL,16,Fhospital.
OL,18,FThe force said an investigation found
OL,19,F"clear mistreatment of the boy over a
OL,20,Fprolonged period of time".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
