OL,3,APolice worker jailed after death of boy
OL,4,Ain her care
OL,5,
OL,6,FWalker, of Appleton Street in Warsop,
OL,7,Fwas jailed for six years at Nottingham
OL,8,FCrown Court on Monday after pleading
OL,9,Fguilty to two counts of
OL,10,Fassault/ill-treat/neglect/abandon a
OL,11,Fchild/young person to cause unnecessary
OL,12,Fsuffering/injury.
